    "detailed_description": "Play as best friends: Chriss and Cross.<br>Join their adventure to build a new a club house. Puzzle through the levels to gather the materials needed!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Who are Chriss and Cross?</h2>Chriss and Cross are best friends with the broadest of imaginations. You both embark on an adventure to have a good time before Chriss heads back to school!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/674f768078cd37b7bacd068764bbdec4.poster.avif?t=1746104583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/674f768078cd37b7bacd068764bbdec4.webm?t=1746104583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/674f768078cd37b7bacd068764bbdec4.mp4?t=1746104583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your wits!</h2><br>Help your friend cross by stepping on the color buttons, which will magically unveil the matching colored bridge! Explore new lands as you solve these puzzles together and discover exciting adventures along the way!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/0afa43789c7495db1cc3eeab49eaf4cb.poster.avif?t=1746104583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/0afa43789c7495db1cc3eeab49eaf4cb.webm?t=1746104583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524620/extras/0afa43789c7495db1cc3eeab49eaf4cb.mp4?t=1746104583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A narrative-driven, co-op game where you get to be a kid again!<br></li><li> Build an amazing tree house<br></li><li> Explore 40+ levels<br></li><li> Enjoy the atmospheric environments<br></li><li> Have fun with a friend or partner!<br></li><li> ... or annoy them by not letting them cross...</li></ul>",
